{"product_id":"blvk-tobacco-nicotine-salt-pistachio","title":"BLVK Tobacco Nicotine Salt - Pistachio","description":"\u003cp\u003ePistachio Salt by BLVK Unicorn is a nicotine salt rendition of nutty pistachios combined with sweet leafy tobacco for a powerful vape that will inspire the senses and tastebuds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning:\u003c\/strong\u003e This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine salt base\"\u003esalt-based nicotine\u003c\/a\u003e e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBLVK Unicorn SALT - Pistachio Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted For Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine: 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546522167,"sku":"BLVK Tobacco - Pistachio 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546554935,"sku":"BLVK Tobacco - Pistachio 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_-_salt_series_-_tobacco_salt_-_pistachio_-_box_bottle.png?v=1747708355","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/blvk-tobacco-nicotine-salt-pistachio","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




